Eddy-like DWI correction library
Copyright 2026 Neurodesk contributors

The JavaScript in src/ is original code under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).

The WebAssembly modules in wasm/ are built from the Rust crates in exes/dwi
(shoreline-wasm, shoreline, shore, pe-field, slice-outliers, ec-distortion) by
scripts/build-wasm.mjs. shoreline, slice-outliers and ec-distortion are
implemented from the published papers, without FSL code, under Apache-2.0. Two
crates port code from the projects below; their licence texts follow, as in
exes/dwi/shore/LICENSE-* and exes/dwi/pe-field/LICENSE-QSIPREP.

- QSIPrep 26.1.1 (3dSHORE prediction in exes/dwi/shore; TopupFieldToWarp and
  jacobian_determinant in exes/dwi/pe-field): BSD-3-Clause
- DIPY (ShoreModel, which QSIPrep's 3dSHORE adapts, and gradient_table and
  cart2sphere in exes/dwi/shore): BSD-3-Clause

The susceptibility field and the brain mask that the dwicorrect app makes come
from @neurodesk/sdc (GPL-3.0-or-later) and MindGrab, separate packages with
their own licences.

